  "text": {
    "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
    "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "nadia.conard@stryker.com",
    "text": "<p>“I’m proud to be a part of the medical technology community, and I’m&nbsp;honored to chair this great trade association, which helps&nbsp;advance our work on behalf of patients and health&nbsp;care progress around the world,” said Lobo. “The&nbsp;medtech&nbsp;ecosystem has never been more vibrant than it is today, with innovators delivering new treatments and cures at a rapid pace. AdvaMed plays a critical role in nurturing that ecosystem, and I’m excited to spearhead those efforts as chair.”&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.advamed.org/newsroom/press-releases/stryker%E2%80%99s-chairman-and-ceo-kevin-lobo-named-chairman-advamed-board-directors\">Read more about the announcement here</a>&nbsp;</p>\n",
